    <descriptions>
        <description xml:lang="en-US" descriptionType="Abstract">            
            The EXMARaLDA Demo Corpus is a small corpus originally designed for demonstrating the functionality of the EXMARaLDA system.
            It consists of a selection of short transcribed audio and video recordings in various languages.
            Version 1.2 is a subset of version 1.1, curated for the Transcription+ project, with the main aim of demonstrating the use
            of ISO 24624:2016 Language resource management — Transcription of spoken language.
        </description>
    </descriptions>
